Description: CUEMS ALSA seq auto-wiring daemon for MTC distribution
 cuems-midi-connector listens to ALSA sequencer announce events and
 auto-wires MTC connections between Midi Through Port-0, rtpmidid,
 MtcMaster, and the per-player MTC receivers across a CUEMS cluster.
 .
 The daemon detects controller vs node role at runtime via the presence
 of /etc/cuems/master.ip and adjusts rtpmidid wiring direction
 accordingly, supporting role-flips without reinstallation.
 .
 This package installs into the /usr/lib/cuems/ virtual environment
 provided by cuems-utils. The console script is installed at
 /usr/lib/cuems/bin/cuems-midiconnector and is invoked by the systemd
 unit shipped in cuems-common.
